TI  - Leveraging PQC and Blockchain for Secure and Verifiable SDN Controller Communication
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of the 11th IEEE International Conference on Network Softwarization, NetSoft 2025
SP  - 567
EP  - 572
DO  - 10.1109/NetSoft64993.2025.11080638
