TI  - Towards Next-generation Multimedia Security: An Integrated Framework of Cryptography, Blockchain, and Quantum-Resilient Techniques
PY  - 2026
T2  - International Journal of Intelligent Engineering and Systems
VL  - 19
IS  - 1
SP  - 16
