TI  - KArAt-KidneyNet: Proactive Threat Hunting and Anomaly Detection Framework for Consumer Wearable Healthcare Electronics in Kidney Disease Diagnosis
PY  - 2026
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Consumer Electronics
