TI  - A Blockchain-Enabled Decentralized Zero-Trust Architecture for Anomaly Detection in Satellite Networks via Post-Quantum Cryptography and Federated Learning
PY  - 2025
T2  - Future Internet
VL  - 17
IS  - 11
C7  - 516
