AB  - AIoT combines Artificial Intelligence (AI) with the Internet of Things (IoT) to enable smart applications in healthcare, transport, industry, and cities. However, the massive data from billions of devices creates risks to privacy, trust, and security. To address this, we propose a federated learning framework with quantum- resistant cryptography and explainable AI. It protects data locally, secures communication, detects attacks, and supports reliable decision- making. Lightweight cryptography, blockchain aggregation, and trust metrics ensure efficiency, integrity, and resilience for future AIoT systems. Β© 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
