TI  - Random Beacons in Monte Carlo: Efficient Asynchronous Random Beacon without Threshold Cryptography
PY  - 2024
T2  - CCS 2024 - Proceedings of the 2024 ACM SIGSAC Conference on Computer and Communications Security
SP  - 2621
EP  - 2635
DO  - 10.1145/3658644.3670326
