TI  - EdgeGuard-IoT: 6G-Enabled Edge Intelligence for Secure Federated Learning and Adaptive Anomaly Detection in Industry 5.0
PY  - 2025
T2  - Computers, Materials and Continua
VL  - 85
IS  - 1
SP  - 695
