AB  - In this paper, we evaluate how quantum computers affect an electronic voting system in general but we also provide a detailed analysis of the Helios voting system. We analyze the two major cryptographic components of Helios that are vulnerable to quantum computers: the encryption scheme and the decryption proof. We investigate the use of Niederreiter cryptosystem as a replacement for the ElGamal encryption scheme and proposed a new decryption proof for this scheme. Β© 2020 Editura Academiei Romane. All rights reserved.
