AB  - Cloud computing, or internet computing, is rapidly evolving, making security a critical concern for users and organizations. This chapter explores advanced encryption techniquesβ€”quantum- resistant, attribute- based, and homomorphic encryptionβ€”to protect data against identity management issues, data theft, and cyber- attacks. It also examines secure multi- party computation and zero- trust architectures to enhance data integrity and confidentiality. Additionally, the integration of AI and machine learning for real- time threat detection, blockchain for decentralized security, and the importance of compliance with standards like GDPR and CCPA are discussed. Β© 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
